r back about the delayed shipment</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-xs" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 60%, transparent);"><span class="flex items-center gap-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15.914 4a1.5 1.5 0 00-2.474-1.561l-9 9A1.5 1.5 0 005.5 14h4.002a.5.5 0 01.471.666L8.086 20a1.5 1.5 0 002.475 1.56l9-9A1.5 1.5 0 0018.5 10h-3.997a.5.5 0 01-.472-.667z"></path></svg>4</span></span></span></span></button></div></section><div data-kro-session-slot="primary-action" class="flex items-end justify-center" style="height: 62px; gap: 24px;"><button type="button" aria-label="Resume session" data-kro-session-action="resume" data-kro-glass-tint="tinted" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] kro-glass kro-glass--tinted" style="width: 62px; height: 62px; color: var(--kro-color-absolute); border-radius: 9999px; --kro-glass-tint: var(--kro-color-focus-green);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play size-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg></button><div class="relative flex items-end"><button type="button" aria-label="Stop session" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_f_" data-kro-session-stop="" class="kro-glass inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]" style="width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 9999px;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square size-5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect></svg></button><div id="_r_f_" role="group" aria-label="Stop session" inert="" aria-hidden="true" data-kro-session-stop-menu="closed" class="kro-glass absolute bottom-[64px] left-1/2 z-10 flex w-40 -translate-x-1/2 flex-col rounded-kro-card p-1" style="opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;"><button type="button" class="rounded-kro-small px-kro-small text-left text-sm outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]" style="min-height: var(--kro-size-min-pointer-target); color: var(--kro-color-fore);">Finish Early</button><button type="button" class="rounded-kro-small px-kro-small text-left text-sm outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]" style="min-height: var(--kro-size-min-pointer-target); color: var(--kro-color-kro-red);">Abort</button></div></div></div><p class="m-0 pb-6 text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 50%, transparent);">Paused</p></div></div><div data-kro-session-deck="concluded" data-kro-session-deck-visible="false" inert="" aria-hidden="true" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col items-center" style="grid-area: 1 / 1; min-width: 0; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; right: 0px;"><div class="flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col items-center" style="gap: 24px;"><p class="m-0 font-semibold text-xl">Session Completed!</p><p data-kro-session-concluded-total="" class="m-0 font-medium font-mono text-base tabular-nums" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 60%, transparent);">00:00 focused</p><div class="flex w-full flex-col px-kro-medium" style="gap: 12px;" data-kro-session-conclusion-actions=""><button type="button" data-kro-session-action="complete" class="kro-glass kro-glass--tinted flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-kro-surface font-semibold outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]" style="height: 56px; color: var(--kro-color-absolute); border-radius: var(--kro-radius-surface); --kro-glass-tint: var(--kro-color-complete-blue);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg>Complete Task</button><div class="flex w-full" style="gap: 12px;"><button type="button" data-kro-session-action="start-new" class="kro-glass kro-glass--tinted flex flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-kro-card font-medium text-sm outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]" style="height: 48px; color: var(--kro-color-absolute); border-radius: var(--kro-radius-card); --kro-glass-tint: var(--kro-color-focus-green);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rotate-cw size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-9-9c2.52 0 4.93 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path></svg>Start New</button></div></div><p class="m-0 pb-6 text-xs" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 40%, transparent);">What would you like to do next?</p></div></div><div data-kro-session-deck="break" data-kro-session-deck-visible="false" inert="" aria-hidden="true" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col items-center" style="grid-area: 1 / 1; min-width: 0; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; right: 0px;"><div class="flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col items-center" style="gap: 24px;"><p class="m-0 font-semibold text-xl">Break Time</p><p data-kro-session-break-remaining="" class="m-0 font-medium font-mono text-base tabular-nums" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 60%, transparent);">25:00 remaining</p><div class="flex w-full flex-col px-kro-medium" style="gap: 12px;"><button type="button" data-kro-session-action="end-break" class="kro-glass kro-glass--tinted flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-kro-surface font-semibold outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]" style="height: 56px; color: var(--kro-color-absolute); border-radius: var(--kro-radius-surface); --kro-glass-tint: var(--kro-color-pastry-green);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rotate-cw size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-9-9c2.52 0 4.93 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path></svg>Start Focus Session</button></div><p class="m-0 pb-6 text-xs" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 40%, transparent);">Tap to end break and continue working</p></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`SessionSheet > renders the Running story as recorded 1`] = `"<div style="width: 390px; background: linear-gradient(150deg, #221b3d 0%, #2f2350 45%, #3a1f45 100%); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 8px 12px 0px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);">Running · green tint · 15:00 left</p><div data-theme="dark" data-kro-session-sheet="running" data-kro-session-presentation="sheet" class="flex w-full flex-col text-kro-fore"><div data-kro-session-slot="header" class="flex items-center justify-between px-kro-medium pt-kro-medium"><button type="button" data-kro-session-close="" aria-label="Close session sheet (session keeps running)" class="kro-glass inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 9999px;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button><div role="group" aria-label="Session mode" aria-disabled="true" data-kro-segmented="" data-kro-density="comfortable" class="inline-flex max-w-[260px]" style="border-radius: var(--kro-radius-pill); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 10%, transparent); opacity: 0.5; pointer-events: none;"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" disabled="" data-kro-segment="selected" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1 font-medium outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] text-sm" style="padding: 8px 16px; min-height: var(--kro-size-min-pointer-target); border-radius: var(--kro-radius-pill); color: var(--kro-color-back); background: var(--kro-color-fore);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-timer size-3" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="10" x2="14" y1="2" y2="2"></line><line x1="12" x2="15" y1="14" y2="11"></line><circle cx="12" cy="14" r="8"></circle></svg>Pomodoro</button></div><span aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block; width: 44px; height: 44px;"></span></div><div data-kro-session-slot="identity" class="flex flex-col items-start gap-kro-small px-8 pt-kro-medium" style="align-items: center;"><div data-kro-session-identity-line="stacked" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-kro-small"><button type="button" data-kro-session-symbol="" aria-label="Change session symbol" title="Opens an emoji picker" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-kro-small outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-[var(--kro-opacity-disabled)]" style="min-width: 56px; min-height: 56px; font-size: 48px; line-height: 1;" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed">📊</button><button type="button" data-kro-session-title="" aria-label="📊 Prepare slides" title="Edit session title" class="line-clamp-2 text-center font-bold text-2xl outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]" style="max-width: 280px; color: var(--kro-color-fore);">📊 Prepare slides</button></div><p data-kro-session-tomatoes="" class="m-0 flex items-center pt-1" style="gap: 2px;" role="img" aria-label="3 completed sessions"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1;">🍅</span><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1;">🍅</span><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1;">🍅</span></p></div><div data-kro-session-dial-group="" class="flex flex-col items-center" style="margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; gap: 10px;"><div data-kro-session-slot="dial" class="flex items-center justify-center" style="height: 164px;"><div class="inline-flex flex-col items-center gap-kro-medium" data-kro-duration-dial=""><div role="slider" aria-label="Session time remaining" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="3600" aria-valuenow="900" aria-valuetext="15 minutes" aria-readonly="true" aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1" class="kro-motion-quick outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]" style="position: relative; width: 164px; height: 164px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; user-select: none; cursor: default;"><svg aria-hidden="true" data-kro-dial-ticks="" width="164" height="164" viewBox="0 0 164 164" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" style="position: absolute; inset: 0;"><defs><clipPath id="_r_u_"><path d="M 82 82 L 82 -82 A 164 164 0 0 1 246.000 82.000 Z"></path></clipPath></defs><circle cx="82" cy="82" r="74" fill="none" stroke="color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 15%, transparent)" stroke-width="16" stroke-dasharray="2.5 5.249261878854823" stroke-dashoffset="1.25" transform="rotate(-90 82 82)"></circle><g data-kro-dial-covered="" clip-path="url(#_r_u_)"><circle cx="82" cy="82" r="74" fill="none" stroke="color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 60%, transparent)" stroke-width="16" stroke-dasharray="2.5 5.249261878854823" stroke-dashoffset="1.25" transform="rotate(-90 82 82)"></circle></g></svg><div aria-hidden="true" data-kro-dial-base="" style="position: absolute; width: 132px; height: 132px; border-radius: 50%; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 4%, transparent);"></div><div aria-hidden="true" data-kro-dial-fill="" style="position: absolute; width: 132px; height: 132px; border-radius: 50%; background: conic-gradient(color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 8%, transparent) 0deg 90deg, transparent 90deg 360deg);"></div><span data-kro-dial-readout="" style="position: relative; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, monospace; color: var(--kro-color-fore); pointer-events: none;">15:00</span></div></div></div><p data-kro-session-slot="status" class="m-0 flex items-center justify-center font-semibold text-xs" style="height: 28px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 50%, transparent);">FOCUSED</p></div><div data-kro-session-slot="deck" class="grid w-full" style="grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);"><div data-kro-session-deck="ready" data-kro-session-deck-visible="false" inert="" aria-hidden="true" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col items-center" style="grid-area: 1 / 1; min-width: 0; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; right: 0px;"><div class="flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col items-center" style="gap: 20px;"><div data-kro-session-slot="deck-lead" data-kro-session-presets="" role="group" aria-label="Duration presets" class="flex w-full min-w-0 items-center justify-center overflow-x-auto px-kro-medium" style="height: 38px; gap: 10px; opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto;"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-kro-session-preset="available" data-kro-density="comfortable" class="shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] text-sm" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-weight: 500; border-radius: var(--kro-radius-pill); color: var(--kro-color-fore); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 10%, transparent);">15m</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-kro-session-preset="available" data-kro-density="comfortable" class="shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] text-sm" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-weight: 500; border-radius: var(--kro-radius-pill); color: var(--kro-color-fore); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 10%, transparent);">20m</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-kro-session-preset="selected" data-kro-density="comfortable" class="shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] text-sm" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: var(--kro-radius-pill); color: var(--kro-color-back); background: var(--kro-color-fore);">25m</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-kro-session-preset="available" data-kro-density="comfortable" class="shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] text-sm" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-weight: 500; border-radius: var(--kro-radius-pill); color: var(--kro-color-fore); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 10%, transparent);">45m</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-kro-session-preset="available" data-kro-density="comfortable" class="shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] text-sm" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-weight: 500; border-radius: var(--kro-radius-pill); color: var(--kro-color-fore); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 10%, transparent);">60m</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-kro-session-preset="available" data-kro-density="comfortable" class="shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] text-sm" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-weight: 500; border-radius: var(--kro-radius-pill); color: var(--kro-color-fore); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 10%, transparent);">90m</button></div><section data-kro-session-slot="suggestions" data-kro-session-suggestions="empty" aria-label="MAYBE DO THIS NEXT?" inert="" aria-hidden="true" class="flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;"><p class="m-0 flex items-center gap-1.5 px-kro-medium font-semibold text-xs" style="letter-spacing: 1px; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kro-color-fore) 50%, transparent);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-arrow-right size-3" aria-hid